title Home Assistant: more entity pages (an area's tiles): a sensor (the word and the room at the top, the favourite row), the thermostat (its temperatures and action as grey values), a tap selects a row and a tap on the selected row acts; the reading lamp (Turn on, no slider: its tile has no chevron)
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO home

wait 1600
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
key pgdn
wait 900
tap "Humidity"
wait 600
shot sensor
check sensor
expect text "48 %"
expect text "Add to favourites"
# touch: the first tap on the favourite row selects it (already selected: the only row), a tap on it acts
tap "Add to favourites"
wait 700
expect text "Remove from favourites"
shot sensor-starred
key esc
wait 500
drag 0.5 0.92 0.5 0.30
wait 400
tap "Thermostat"
wait 600
shot climate
check climate
expect text "Heat, 21.4 °C"
expect text "Temperature"
expect text "21.4 °C"
expect text "Target"
key esc
wait 500
tap "Reading lamp"
wait 600
shot lamp
check lamp
expect text "Turn on"
expect notext "Brightness"
key enter
wait 900
expect text "Turn off"
shot lamp-on
expect noquit
